From 95ce864812a6afff4511868dd3fd152a8929b082 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sapphire <imsapphire0@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 18:59:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] d/solarxr: Fix driver after SolarXR breaking changes in
 server-rewrite

In server-rewrite, SlimeVR no longer sends computed trackers in the
`DataFeedUpdate::synthetic_trackers` field (which no longer exists).
Now we use the bones from the data feed update as the data source for
skeletal body tracking extensions and the xdevs.

Signed-off-by: Sapphire <imsapphire0@gmail.com>
---
 src/xrt/drivers/solarxr/feeder.c         |   8 +-
 src/xrt/drivers/solarxr/protocol.c       | 161 ++---
 src/xrt/drivers/solarxr/protocol.h       | 233 ++++---
 src/xrt/drivers/solarxr/solarxr_device.c | 749 ++++++-----------------
 4 files changed, 409 insertions(+), 742 deletions(-)

